{"error": false, "page": 3, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 3, "recordCount": 212, "data": [{"docid2": 222375, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222375.htm", "content": "　　2009年我市环境保护状况公报显示：市区年空气优良率为94.2%，同比上年提高 1.6个百分点；10个县（市）空气质量均达到或优于国家二级标准；全市连续四年实现化学需氧量和二氧化硫双减排，提前一年完成“十一五”减", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222375.htm", "docreltime": "2010.08.30 08:58:00", "doctitle": "关于加强我市环境保护、建设生态名市的建议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 224450, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222375.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 222374, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222374.htm", "content": "\n　　对外开放是海峡西岸经济区建设的首要前提。实施“开放活市”战略是主动融入海峡西岸经济区建设的必然抉择。今年是“十一五”实施的最后一年，展望未来，如何科学、合理地制定“十二五”规划，是摆在各级、各部门", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222374.htm", "docreltime": "2010.08.30 08:57:00", "doctitle": "转变对外经贸发展方式提升对外开放水平之我见", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 224449, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222374.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 222373, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222373.htm", "content": "　　转变经济发展方式是中央作出的重大决策，也是深入贯彻落实科学发展观，实现三明在海西建设中更好更快发展的迫切要求和根本出路。我市经济总量小，传统产业比重较大，产业比较粗放，集中度不高，自主创新能力薄弱", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222373.htm", "docreltime": "2010.08.30 08:56:00", "doctitle": "落实科学发展观加快转变经济发展方式", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 224448, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/t20100830_222373.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201008/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 220869, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201007/t20100720_220869.htm", "content": "\n　　日前，我市召开“十二五”经济社会发展规划总体思路征求意见专题会，市委常委、常务副市长张发录，省政府发展研究中心副主任王开明到会讲话。\n　　专题会上，省政府发展研究中心课题组的专家介绍了三明“十二五", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201007/t20100720_220869.htm", "docreltime": "2010.07.13 10:17:00", "doctitle": "三明 “十二五”经济社会发展规划总体思路征求意见专题会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 222944, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201007/t20100720_220869.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/201007/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 213089, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200909/t20090915_213089.htm", "content": "\n　　最近，将乐县人大常委会组织调研组深入有关乡镇和单位，对将乐县实施“十一五”规划纲要情况进行调研。调研组听取了县政府关于实施“十一五”规划纲要工作情况汇报，针对个别指标完成难度较大等问题，建议：要深", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200909/t20090915_213089.htm", "docreltime": "2009.09.15 17:14:00", "doctitle": "将乐县人大开展“十一五”规划实施情况调研", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 215164, "sourcename": "三明人大信息", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200909/t20090915_213089.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200909/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 205978, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200811/t20081128_205978.htm", "content": "\n　　据统计，截止2007年底，我市60岁以上的老龄人口41.3万，其中，65岁以上的老年人30万，占全市人口总数的比重分别为15.7％和11.3％，比全国平均水平高4.4和3.4个百分点，比全省平均水平高3.2和2.4个百分点。随着我", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200811/t20081128_205978.htm", "docreltime": "2008.11.28 10:25:00", "doctitle": "我市“十一五”时期国家和省级安排老年公寓专项建设情况", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 208053, "sourcename": "三明市发改委网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200811/t20081128_205978.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200811/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 204016, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204016.htm", "content": "\n　　2007年,在市委正确领导下，经过全市人民共同努力，全市经济社会保持又好又快发展态势，市十一届人大一次会议批准的国民经济和社会发展主要预期目标顺利实现。初步统计，全市生产总值551.32亿元，比增15.4%；农林", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204016.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.22 16:53:00", "doctitle": "2007年国民经济和社会发展计划执行情况", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206091, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204016.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 204015, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204015.htm", "content": "\n　　初步统计，地区生产总值392.1亿元，比增10.5％，完成年计划100.9％；农林牧渔业总产值152．77亿元，比增5．7％，完成年计划100.7％；规模以_上工业总产值385．43亿元，比增21．6％，完成年计划103.1％；全社会固", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204015.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.22 16:50:00", "doctitle": "2005年三明市经济和社会发展情况", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206090, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204015.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 204014, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204014.htm", "content": "\n　　初步统计，地区生产总值451.59亿元，比增13.1％，为1998年以来最好水平，完成年计划103.3％；农林牧渔业总产值169.13亿元，比增6.5％，为2000年以来最好水平，完成年计划100％；规模以上工业总产值479.9亿元，比", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204014.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.22 16:47:00", "doctitle": "2006年三明市经济和社会发展情况", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206089, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080822_204014.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 201544, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_201544.htm", "content": "\n　　近年来，我市把改善农村道路交通条件作为新农村建设的“先行工程”抓实抓好。目前，我市农村公路改造、硬化完成1282公里，硬化路面通村率为97.3%，提前3年完成农村公路硬化的“十一五”建设目标。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_201544.htm", "docreltime": "2008.04.07 10:00:00", "doctitle": "三明提前3年完成农村公路硬化“十一五”目标", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 203619, "sourcename": "中国公路网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_201544.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 199416, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_199416.htm", "content": "\n　　从三明市重点办获悉，已规划建设三明城市物流中心、闽西北(沙县)物流园区。\n　　三明城市物流中心规划建于三明市区翁墩后山。该物流中心规划面积3.5平方公里，是以工业仓储、汽车贸易、物流运输以及农林产品交易", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_199416.htm", "docreltime": "2007.10.26 10:15:00", "doctitle": "三明规划建设两大物流中心", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 201491, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_199416.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 194646, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展情况", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_194646.htm", "content": "\n　　6月1日，闽西北第一座500千伏变电站———三阳变电站在三明动工建设，这是我省“十一五”，也是不久前国家电网公司与省委、省政府签署加快推进海峡西岸电网建设会谈纪要之后，开工建设的又一座500千伏输变电工程", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_194646.htm", "docreltime": "2006.06.02 10:02:00", "doctitle": "“十一五”三明电网建设和改造投资36.5亿元", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 196721, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/t20080824_194646.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghdt/200808/", "rels": []}]}